From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:22:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ios): forward hardware Tab from credential text areas to
 Compose

Email/password KRTextAreaView fields swallow hardware Tab (UITextView
inserts "\t"). Intercept Tab/Shift+Tab via pressesBegan, keyCommands and
shouldChangeText, and forward it as a Compose key event through
KuiklyRenderView sendKeyEventWithKeyCode: so onPreviewKeyEvent focus
traversal works. Depends on the hardware key event patch.

Fork-Patch: ios-textarea-tab-key-forward
Origin: 9bd3a444
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
---
 .../Extension/Components/KRTextAreaView.m     | 69 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 69 insertions(+)

